The root `AGENTS.md` is the single authoritative agent instruction file for this
repository. Read it before doing anything, and follow its Principles — they
override every other instruction in this repo.

The shared knowledge base lives under `.agents/`:

- `.agents/context/dev-spec/` — stack, conventions, git workflow, prerequisites
- `.agents/context/product/` — product vision and the offload domain model
- `.agents/skills/` — reusable workflows

This rule file is a pointer only and must never accumulate its own instructions.
